OL,3,ABurnham setting out new UK-EU deal in
OL,4,Athe House of Commons
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is setting out his new
OL,7,FUK-EU deal in the House of Commons,
OL,8,Fafter it was agreed with European
OL,9,Fleaders on Friday - watch live above
OL,11,FThe deal includes a youth mobility
OL,12,Fscheme, scrapping most checks on
OL,13,FBritish food exports, and the linking
OL,14,Fof EU and UK emissions trading systems
OL,15,F- see a recap here
OL,17,FAt the CBI conference in London,
OL,18,Fcabinet minister Louise Haigh says the
OL,19,Fdeal will "bring down the cost of
OL,20,Fbusiness [and] help with the cost of
OL,21,Ffood"
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
