OL,3,ALongest-ever UN climate talks end with
OL,4,Ano deal as deep divisions exposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, many poorer countries
OL,7,Fobjected to the absence of any clear
OL,8,Ffinancial commitments from richer
OL,9,Fnations to help them adapt to the
OL,10,Fimpacts of rising temperatures.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
